1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,600
Nearly 69% of gym injuries come from ego lifting too heavy.

2
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:10,800
The shoulder gets hurt the most - watch for impingement.

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:15,600
Rounding your back on deadlifts crushes your lumbar discs.

4
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:20,200
Knees caving inward tear the meniscus in your knee.

5
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:26,000
Injured? Use RICE and rest - recovery is where you grow.

